IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ssaa-types`
IMPORT `ssaa-rules`
IMPORT `ssaa-goal`

-- Social Security Administration Act 1992 (UK) — the encoder's tests.
-- Expected values are worked by hand from the Act.

§ `Tests`

§§ `Goal 1 — recoverable overpayments`

#ASSERT `the amount recoverable under s 71 for` (`Overpayment facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 1000) EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT `the amount recoverable under s 71 for` (`Overpayment facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 1000) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the amount recoverable under s 71 for` (`Overpayment facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, 1000) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the amount recoverable under s 71 for` (`Overpayment facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, 1000) EQUALS 0

§§ `Goal 2 — offences`

#ASSERT `the benefit offence for` (`Offence facts` OF `made a false statement or provided false information`, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS `an offence under s 111A (dishonesty)`
#ASSERT `the benefit offence for` (`Offence facts` OF `failed to notify a change of circumstances`, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS `an offence under s 112`
#ASSERT `the benefit offence for` (`Offence facts` OF `failed to notify a change of circumstances`, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS `an offence under s 111A (dishonesty)`
#ASSERT `the benefit offence for` (`Offence facts` OF `made a false statement or provided false information`, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS `no offence`
#ASSERT `the maximum sentence for` `an offence under s 111A (dishonesty)` EQUALS JUST (`Maximum sentence` OF 6, JUST 7)
#ASSERT `the maximum sentence for` `an offence under s 112` EQUALS JUST (`Maximum sentence` OF 3, NOTHING)
#ASSERT `the maximum sentence for` `no offence` EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Goal 3 — the administrative penalty`

GIVEN made IS A BOOLEAN, amount IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Penalty facts`
`a penalty case, overpaid` made `, amount` amount MEANS
    `Penalty facts` OF made, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, amount, JUST (Date 20 2 2027)

#ASSERT `the administrative penalty for` (`a penalty case, overpaid` TRUE `, amount` 500) EQUALS 350
#ASSERT `the administrative penalty for` (`a penalty case, overpaid` TRUE `, amount` 700) EQUALS 350
#ASSERT `the administrative penalty for` (`a penalty case, overpaid` TRUE `, amount` 1000) EQUALS 500
#ASSERT `the administrative penalty for` (`a penalty case, overpaid` TRUE `, amount` 10000) EQUALS 5000
#ASSERT `the administrative penalty for` (`a penalty case, overpaid` TRUE `, amount` 12000) EQUALS 5000
-- Rounded down to the penny: 50% of £1,234.57 is £617.285, so £617.28.
#ASSERT `the administrative penalty for` (`a penalty case, overpaid` TRUE `, amount` 1234.57) EQUALS 617.28
-- s 115A(1A): no overpayment made.
#ASSERT `the administrative penalty for` (`a penalty case, overpaid` FALSE `, amount` 0) EQUALS 350
-- Not attributable to the person: no notice.
#ASSERT `the administrative penalty for` (`Penalty facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, 1000, NOTHING) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the administrative penalty for` (`Penalty facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, 1000, NOTHING) EQUALS 0
-- s 115A(5): agreed 20 February 2027, may withdraw until 5 March 2027.
#ASSERT `the last day to withdraw agreement for` (`a penalty case, overpaid` TRUE `, amount` 1000) EQUALS JUST (Date 5 3 2027)
#ASSERT `the last day to withdraw agreement for` (`Penalty facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 1000, NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `The top-level goal`

pos MEANS `the overpayment position for` (`Overpayment case` OF JUST (`Overpayment facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 1000), JUST (`Offence facts` OF `failed to notify a change of circumstances`, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE), JUST (`a penalty case, overpaid` TRUE `, amount` 1000))
#ASSERT pos's `amount recoverable` EQUALS JUST 1000
#ASSERT pos's `offence` EQUALS JUST `an offence under s 112`
#ASSERT pos's `maximum sentence` EQUALS JUST (`Maximum sentence` OF 3, NOTHING)
#ASSERT pos's `administrative penalty` EQUALS JUST 500
#ASSERT pos's `last day to withdraw agreement` EQUALS JUST (Date 5 3 2027)
